          "type": "Bool"
        },
        {
          "name": "Inside Tick",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Allocates reflection captures in the scene's reflection cubemap array and updates them by recapturing the scene.\nExisting captures will only be updated.  Must be called from the game thread."
