          "name": "Invalidate Priority",
          "type": "EVTInvalidatePriority"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Invalidates pages in a runtime virtual texture object.\n@param Component RVT component containing the runtime virtual texture to invalidate\n@param WorldBounds World-space bounds of the area of the runtime virtual texture to invalidate\n@param InvalidatePriority Ensures the corresponding pages get processed in priority. This allows increased responsiveness when\nthere are more pages being updated than can be handled in a given frame (when throttling)"
